{"id":"14f4c4c1-ceda-4e6d-9203-c810f33c1165","createdAt":"2026-10-26T13:56:05.783Z","batchId":"pricing_gpt-6-1-sol_low","approach":"html","modelId":"gpt-6.1-sol","settings":{"effort":"low"},"presetId":"pricing","prompt":"A pricing page with three plans (Free, Pro, Team), their features and a call to action for each.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n  <header class=\"stack center\">\n    <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Simple, transparent pricing</span>\n    <h1 class=\"h1\">The right plan for your next step</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead muted\">Start for free, unlock more as you grow, or bring your whole team together.</p>\n    <div class=\"row gap-sm\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Billing frequency\">\n      <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" id=\"monthly\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Monthly</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" id=\"annual\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Yearly · save 20%</button>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"small muted\" id=\"billing-note\" aria-live=\"polite\">Paid plans are billed monthly. Prices in USD.</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"grid cols-3 gap-lg\" aria-label=\"Pricing plans\">\n    <article class=\"card stack\">\n      <div>\n        <h2 class=\"h2\">Free</h2>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">A little room to explore and get organized.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <span class=\"stat-value\">$0</span>\n        <span class=\"muted\"> / forever</span>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">For one person. No credit card required.</p>\n      </div>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-outline btn-block\" href=\"#signup\" data-plan=\"Free\">Get started free</a>\n      <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n      <h3 class=\"h4\">The essentials</h3>\n      <ul class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <li>3 active projects</li>\n        <li>Unlimited tasks and notes</li>\n        <li>1 GB of file storage</li>\n        <li>7-day activity history</li>\n        <li>Community support</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"small muted\">Best for personal projects and trying things out.</p>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"card stack\">\n      <div class=\"row between gap-sm\">\n        <h2 class=\"h2\">Pro</h2>\n        <span class=\"badge\">Most popular</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">More power for your personal workflow.</p>\n      <div>\n        <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"pro-price\">$15</span>\n        <span class=\"muted\"> / month</span>\n        <p class=\"small muted\" id=\"pro-billing\">$15 billed monthly. For one person.</p>\n      </div>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-block\" href=\"#signup\" data-plan=\"Pro\">Choose Pro</a>\n      <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n      <h3 class=\"h4\">Everything in Free, plus</h3>\n      <ul class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <li>Unlimited active projects</li>\n        <li>100 GB of file storage</li>\n        <li>Unlimited activity history</li>\n        <li>Custom templates and recurring tasks</li>\n        <li>Advanced search and exports</li>\n        <li>Priority email support</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"small muted\">Best for independent professionals with more to manage.</p>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"card stack\">\n      <div>\n        <h2 class=\"h2\">Team</h2>\n        <p class=\"card-desc\">A shared space to plan, collaborate, and deliver.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"team-price\">$25</span>\n        <span class=\"muted\"> / member / month</span>\n        <p class=\"small muted\" id=\"team-billing\">$25 per member billed monthly. Minimum 2 members.</p>\n      </div>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-outline btn-block\" href=\"#signup\" data-plan=\"Team\">Choose Team</a>\n      <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n      <h3 class=\"h4\">Everything in Pro, plus</h3>\n      <ul class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <li>Shared projects and team workspaces</li>\n        <li>1 TB of shared file storage</li>\n        <li>Member roles and permissions</li>\n        <li>Team reporting and workload views</li>\n        <li>Centralized billing</li>\n        <li>Priority support for your team</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"small muted\">Best for teams that need visibility and coordination.</p>\n    </article>\n  </section>\n\n  <p class=\"small muted center\">Upgrade whenever you need more. Cancel renewal anytime; paid features stay available through the end of your billing period.</p>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack\" id=\"signup\" hidden aria-labelledby=\"signup-title\">\n    <h2 class=\"h3\" id=\"signup-title\">Get started</h2>\n    <p id=\"selection-summary\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n    <p class=\"muted small\">Account registration is not connected on this preview. You can compare plans or change your billing preference above.</p>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" type=\"button\" id=\"dismiss\">Back to plans</button>\n  </section>\n</div>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  let yearly = false;\n  const monthlyButton = document.getElementById('monthly');\n  const annualButton = document.getElementById('annual');\n  function update(value) {\n    yearly = value;\n    monthlyButton.className = 'btn ' + (yearly ? 'btn-outline' : 'btn-secondary');\n    annualButton.className = 'btn ' + (yearly ? 'btn-secondary' : 'btn-outline');\n    monthlyButton.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(!yearly));\n    annualButton.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(yearly));\n    document.getElementById('pro-price').textContent = yearly ? '$12' : '$15';\n    document.getElementById('team-price').textContent = yearly ? '$20' : '$25';\n    document.getElementById('pro-billing').textContent = yearly ? '$144 billed yearly. Save $36 per year.' : '$15 billed monthly. For one person.';\n    document.getElementById('team-billing').textContent = yearly ? '$240 per member billed yearly. Minimum 2 members.' : '$25 per member billed monthly. Minimum 2 members.';\n    document.getElementById('billing-note').textContent = yearly ? 'Monthly equivalent shown; paid plans are billed yearly. Prices in USD.' : 'Paid plans are billed monthly. Prices in USD.';\n    document.getElementById('signup').hidden = true;\n  }\n  monthlyButton.onclick = () => update(false);\n  annualButton.onclick = () => update(true);\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-plan]').forEach(link => {\n    link.addEventListener('click', function () {\n      const plan = this.dataset.plan;\n      document.getElementById('signup').hidden = false;\n      document.getElementById('signup-title').textContent = 'You selected ' + plan;\n      document.getElementById('selection-summary').textContent = plan === 'Free' ? 'Free forever. No credit card required.' : plan + ' with ' + (yearly ? 'yearly' : 'monthly') + ' billing. ' + (plan === 'Team' ? 'Minimum 2 members.' : 'For one person.');\n    });\n  });\n  document.getElementById('dismiss').onclick = function () {\n    document.getElementById('signup').hidden = true;\n    monthlyButton.focus();\n  };\n})();\n</script>","deltas":[[1798,"<div"],[1801," class"],[1803,"=\""],[1804,"page"],[1805," stack"],[1805," gap"],[1911,"-lg"],[1914,"\">\n"],[1917," "],[1923," <"],[1925,"header"],[1926," class"],[1926,"=\""],[1926,"stack"],[2024," center"],[2026,"\">\n"],[2029,"   "],[2029," <"],[2144,"span"],[2148," class"],[2148,"=\""],[2153,"badge"],[2153," badge"],[2259,"-secondary"],[2268,"\">"],[2380,"Simple"],[2387,","],[2498," transparent"],[2503," pricing"],[2507,"</"],[2511,"span"],[2514,">\n"],[2516,"   "],[2520," <"],[2523,"h"],[2526,"1"],[2536," class"],[2536,"=\""],[2537,"h"],[2538,"1"],[2539,